---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const liveDemoUrl = '/demo/business-website/';
---

<Layout
	title="Business Website Design & Development Demo | Lakmuthu Studio"
	description="A demonstration of the complete, responsive public websites Lakmuthu Studio can design and build for real businesses."
	image="/images/business-website-demo.png"
>
	<section class="project-hero">
		<div class="wrap project-hero-grid">
			<div>
				<a class="back-link" href="/#work">← Back to work examples</a>
				<span class="eyebrow">Business website demo</span>
				<h1>A complete public website designed around a real customer journey.</h1>
				<p class="project-lede">
					This fictional boutique-hotel project demonstrates the kind of polished,
					multi-page website I can create for a real business—from clear navigation and
					service information to location details and customer inquiries.
				</p>
				<div class="project-actions">
					<a class="btn btn-primary" href={liveDemoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View live demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/#contact">Discuss a similar project</a>
				</div>
				<p class="demo-note">Marula House is fictional and is used only as realistic sample content for the website build.</p>
			</div>

			<dl class="project-facts" aria-label="Project details">
				<div><dt>Deliverable</dt><dd>Six-page business website</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Capabilities</dt><dd>Design and front-end development</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Business type</dt><dd>Small hospitality business</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Experience</dt><dd>Responsive and interactive</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="project-showcase">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="browser-frame">
				<div class="browser-bar" aria-hidden="true">
					<span></span><span></span><span></span>
					<div>marulahouse.demo</div>
				</div>
				<button class="preview-trigger" type="button" aria-label="Open a clean full-screen view of the business website">
					<img
						src="/images/business-website-demo.webp"
						alt="Desktop home page of the colourful Marula House hotel website"
						width="1440"
						height="1000"
					/>
					<span class="preview-hint">View clean preview <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
				</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<dialog class="preview-dialog" aria-label="Business website clean preview">
		<div class="preview-toolbar">
			<p>Business website demo</p>
			<button class="preview-close" type="button" aria-label="Close preview">Close <span aria-hidden="true">×</span></button>
		</div>
		<div class="preview-canvas">
			<img
				src="/images/business-website-demo.webp"
				alt="Full clean view of the Marula House business website home page"
				width="1440"
				height="1000"
			/>
		</div>
	</dialog>

	<section class="project-content">
		<div class="wrap project-content-grid">
			<div class="section-head">
				<span class="eyebrow">What I built</span>
				<h2>A connected website, not a single promotional page.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="project-copy">
				<p class="project-intro">
					The project covers the core information architecture a small public-facing
					business needs: dedicated pages for the company, its services, visual proof,
					location, and customer contact.
				</p>
				<p>
					I created the visual identity, page hierarchy, shared navigation, responsive
					components, room presentation, photo viewer, illustrated map, and a realistic
					but demo-safe inquiry flow. Every page feels part of the same business rather
					than a collection of disconnected screens.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="project-features">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="section-head compact-head">
				<span class="eyebrow">What it demonstrates</span>
				<h2>The foundations of a trustworthy business website</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-cards">
				<article>
					<span>01</span>
					<h3>Multi-page structure</h3>
					<p>Home, About, Rooms, Gallery, Location, and Contact pages give each customer question an appropriate place.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span>02</span>
					<h3>Business-specific design</h3>
					<p>A warm hospitality identity, original imagery, and clear service presentation make the site feel credible and distinctive.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span>03</span>
					<h3>Responsive customer journey</h3>
					<p>Navigation, room cards, galleries, maps, forms, and calls to action work cleanly across desktop and mobile.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span>04</span>
					<h3>Practical inquiry flow</h3>
					<p>The contact experience demonstrates booking and WhatsApp entry points without sending data to a real person or business.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="page-list-section">
		<div class="wrap page-list-grid">
			<div>
				<span class="eyebrow">Included pages</span>
				<h2>Enough room for the business to explain itself properly.</h2>
			</div>
			<ol class="page-list">
				<li><span>01</span><strong>Home</strong><small>Overview and primary customer paths</small></li>
				<li><span>02</span><strong>About</strong><small>Story, positioning, and values</small></li>
				<li><span>03</span><strong>Rooms</strong><small>Detailed service and pricing presentation</small></li>
				<li><span>04</span><strong>Gallery</strong><small>Visual proof with a clean photo viewer</small></li>
				<li><span>05</span><strong>Location</strong><small>Nearby places and practical travel details</small></li>
				<li><span>06</span><strong>Contact</strong><small>Availability form and inquiry options</small></li>
			</ol>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="project-cta">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="project-cta-card">
				<div>
					<span class="eyebrow">Explore the build</span>
					<h2>Browse the complete website.</h2>
					<p>Open the multi-page demo, or get in touch to discuss a website structured around your own business.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="project-actions">
					<a class="btn btn-primary" href={liveDemoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View live demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/#contact">Start a conversation</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<script>
	const previewDialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('.preview-dialog');
	const previewTrigger = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.preview-trigger');
	const previewClose = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.preview-close');
	previewTrigger?.addEventListener('click', () => previewDialog?.showModal());
	previewClose?.addEventListener('click', () => previewDialog?.close());
	previewDialog?.addEventListener('click', event => {
		if (event.target === previewDialog) previewDialog.close();
	});
</script>

<style>
	.project-hero { padding: 96px 0 76px; }
	.project-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(260px, .65fr); gap: clamp(52px, 8vw, 100px); align-items: end; }
	.back-link { display: block; width: fit-content; margin-bottom: 34px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; }
	.back-link:hover { color: var(--blue); }
	h1 { max-width: 880px; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.3rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
	.project-lede { max-width: 680px; margin-top: 26px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
	.project-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 32px; }
	.demo-note { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .78rem; }
	.project-facts { margin: 0; padding: 8px 28px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: rgba(255,255,255,.66); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
	.project-facts div { padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.project-facts div:last-child { border: 0; }
	.project-facts dt { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.project-facts dd { margin: 5px 0 0; color: var(--blue-deep); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; }
	.project-showcase { padding: 0 0 108px; }
	.browser-frame { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(11,36,71,.16); border-radius: 18px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 32px 80px -42px rgba(11,36,71,.7); }
	.browser-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; height: 46px; padding: 0 16px; background: #f1ebe3; }
	.browser-bar > span { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d6cabe; }
	.browser-bar > span:first-child { background: #ee7761; }
	.browser-bar > span:nth-child(2) { background: #e8a33d; }
	.browser-bar > span:nth-child(3) { background: #63ad81; }
	.browser-bar div { margin-left: 10px; padding: 5px 16px; border-radius: 7px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.72); color: #68777b; font-size: .7rem; }
	.preview-trigger { position: relative; display: block; width: 100%; padding: 0; border: 0; background: #fff; cursor: zoom-in; }
	.preview-trigger img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
	.preview-hint { position: absolute; right: 18px; bottom: 18px; display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(11,36,71,.92); color: white; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
	.project-content { padding: 104px 0; background: var(--panel); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.project-content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr); gap: clamp(52px,7vw,80px); align-items: start; }
	.project-content .section-head { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.project-content h2, .project-features h2, .page-list-section h2, .project-cta h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.3rem); }
	.project-copy { color: var(--ink-soft); padding-top: 58px; }
	.project-copy p { margin-bottom: 18px; line-height: 1.75; }
	.project-copy .project-intro { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.18rem; }
	.project-features { padding: 104px 0; }
	.compact-head { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 42px; }
	.feature-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 22px; }
	.feature-cards article { padding: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--panel); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
	.feature-cards article > span { display: block; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--gold); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 800; }
	.feature-cards h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
	.feature-cards p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.page-list-section { padding: 104px 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,.48); }
	.page-list-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: 80px; }
	.page-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
	.page-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 42px .7fr 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; padding: 19px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.page-list li > span { color: var(--gold); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 800; }
	.page-list strong { color: var(--blue-deep); }
	.page-list small { color: var(--ink-soft); }
	.project-cta { padding: 104px 0; }
	.project-cta-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 50px; align-items: end; padding: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--blue-deep); color: white; }
	.project-cta-card h2 { color: white; }
	.project-cta-card p { max-width: 620px; margin-top: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
	.project-cta-card .eyebrow { color: var(--blue-deep); }
	.project-cta-card .btn-primary { background: var(--gold); color: var(--blue-deep); }
	.project-cta-card .btn-ghost { color: white; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
	.project-cta-card .project-actions { margin-top: 0; }
	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.project-hero-grid, .project-content-grid, .page-list-grid, .project-cta-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.project-copy { padding-top: 0; }
		.project-content-grid, .page-list-grid { gap: 34px; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.project-hero { padding: 54px 0 60px; }
		h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 12vw, 2.75rem); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
		.project-actions { flex-direction: column; }
		.project-actions .btn { width: 100%; }
		.project-facts { width: 100%; padding: 5px 20px; }
		.project-facts div { padding: 16px 0; }
		.project-showcase { padding-bottom: 76px; }
		.browser-frame { border-radius: 11px; }
		.browser-bar { height: 40px; padding: 0 10px; gap: 5px; }
		.browser-bar div { min-width: 0; max-width: 170px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
		.preview-hint { right: 10px; bottom: 10px; padding: 8px 11px; font-size: .7rem; }
		.project-content, .project-features, .page-list-section, .project-cta { padding: 76px 0; }
		.feature-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.feature-cards article { padding: 24px 20px; }
		.page-list li { grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; }
		.page-list small { grid-column: 2; }
		.project-cta-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
	}
</style>

<style is:global>
	.preview-dialog { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100vw; max-width: none; height: 100dvh; max-height: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 0; outline: 0; background: #f7f4ef; color: var(--ink); box-shadow: none; }
	.preview-dialog[open] { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
	.preview-dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(11,36,71,.76); }
	.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar { position: sticky; z-index: 2; top: 0; flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 64px; padding: 10px clamp(18px,3vw,42px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11,36,71,.12); background: rgba(255,255,255,.96); }
	.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar p { margin: 0; color: var(--blue-deep); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; }
	.preview-dialog .preview-close { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 8px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: white; color: var(--blue-deep); font: 700 .8rem var(--font-body); cursor: pointer; }
	.preview-dialog .preview-canvas { flex: 1 1 auto; display: grid; place-items: start center; min-height: 0; padding: clamp(16px,3vw,44px); overflow: auto; background: #f7f4ef; }
	.preview-dialog .preview-canvas img { display: block; width: min(1440px,100%); max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0; background: white; box-shadow: 0 24px 64px -38px rgba(11,36,71,.55); }
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar { min-height: 56px; padding: 8px 12px; gap: 12px; }
		.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar p { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
		.preview-dialog .preview-close { flex: 0 0 auto; }
		.preview-dialog .preview-canvas { padding: 8px; }
	}
</style>
